[TITLE]
Slot program fixture (b): pressurized transmission main, modeled after the
TwinOaks field case (9-ft circular, ~30,000 ft, 777 cfs = 502 MGD supply).
Junctions are sealed (SurDepth 200) as pressure-main manholes, so the
main truly pressurizes end to end like the field case. The profile is
FLAT (570 ft), so the ~116 ft friction grade at 777 cfs is carried as
surcharge head - the pumped-flat-main regime where slot storage bites.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
FLOW_ROUTING         FV
START_DATE           01/01/2026
START_TIME           00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2026
END_TIME             06:00:00
REPORT_STEP          00:05:00
